## UxPlay (receive stack)

- Project: https://github.com/FDH2/UxPlay
- License: GNU GPLv3 (see upstream LICENSE)
- Role: AirPlay2 mirror/audio server used as a managed child process for v1
- Local fetch/build: `receiver/build.ps1` → `receiver/uxplay/`

UxPlay itself includes additional third-party code (e.g. playfair, llhttp, and
related AirPlay stack lineage). See the upstream tree for full notices.

## GStreamer (via MSYS2 UCRT64)

- https://gstreamer.freedesktop.org/
- Runtime plugins used for decode/display when running `uxplay.exe`
- Packaged through MSYS2 mingw-w64-ucrt-x86_64-gst-* packages

## mDNS

- Default UxPlay ≥ 1.74 build uses UxPlay's internal minimal mDNSResponder
  implementation (no Apple Bonjour SDK required for the default cmake config).
